{"id":"d816c9cae96d1191","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-meager.md","title":"Meager Set","display":"df-meager — Meager Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-meager","aliases":["58-df-meager"],"display":"df-meager — Meager Set","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-meager"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-meager</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-meager — Meager Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db1cdbf32eacfd38\" href=\"?note=db1cdbf32eacfd38\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md\">../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq X\">\\(A \\subseteq X\\)</span> (子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (拓扑空间, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}\\)</span> (defined here; meager-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(\\cdot;X)\">\\(\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(\\cdot;X)\\)</span> (nowhere-dense predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db1cdbf32eacfd38\" href=\"?note=db1cdbf32eacfd38\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md\">../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}meager} \\vdash \\mathrm{Meager}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists\\vec N\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec N(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(\\vec N(n);X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}meager} \\vdash \\mathrm{Meager}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists\\vec N\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec N(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(\\vec N(n);X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A meager set is a countable union of nowhere dense sets.</li>\n<li>The Baire category theorem says no nonempty open set is meager.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"db1cdbf32eacfd38","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../ba